  "details": "OBS (Open Broadcaster Software) is updating it's Capture Hook Certificate since it's about to expire. Because of this, Anti-Cheat Solutions must be updated in order for OBS to work with it.\n\nAs we all know VRChat plays a critical role in the Streaming environment, this is extremely important to consider. OBS is calling on all Devs who use Anti-Cheat with their games to accommodate the new change with the upcoming OBS 31.0.\n\nMore information: https://obsproject.com/kb/capture-hook-certificate-update\n\nAs you will read here, there are problems with Easy Anti-Cheat (which VRChat uses) that will cause incompatibility issues with the New Certificate. So I am calling on all VRChat Devs to work on ensuring it's compatible with the new certificate as soon as possible.",
